---
title: Plus More
description: A small test recipe whose extra amounts go in a later step.
course: main
icons: [cheese, potato, egg]
---

Mix the @pork{1%lb}, @salt{1%tsp}(or more to taste), @black pepper{1/2%tsp}(plus more to taste) and @flour{1%cup}(5 oz, plus more for dusting).

Heat the @olive oil{2%tbsp}(fruity, plus more for drizzling) and brown the pork.

Season the sauce with @&salt{}, @&black pepper{} and stir in the @&olive oil{1%tbsp}.

Drizzle with @&olive oil{} to serve.
